ck on process states: starting, completion, saving, and deletion, indicating a focus on user interaction and data persistence. These UI strings reinforce the previous conclusion about the matching process, log management, and server control functionalities.\n\n\nThe interface text describes the server controls and the core data matching operation. The user initiates the matching by importing shortage and warehouse files, and the application reports back the overall matching rate.\n\nMatching workflow appears to involve importing shortage and warehouse files, a background matching process with log tracking, and a final Excel-based review step. It seems the system can successfully export a report with total stats and unmatched item count, suggesting it may handle error states appropriately.\n\n\nThe interface provides functionality to apply changes, likely transferring reviewed items.  A dedicated \"Results Folder\" button implies the system generates output files.  Process history reveals run status tracking, error handling, and the ability to restart failed jobs.\n\nThe system settings offer AI server configuration options including a \"best\" profile for Arabic drug names, which indicates the system has specific optimizations.  This suggests the matching engine is designed to handle potentially complex text extraction scenarios. The user can configure the AI server and API keys, supporting both local and external API calls.\n\n\nThis new text introduces specific UI elements for server configuration, session management, and log viewing, indicating direct control over the application's backend. The presence of confirmation dialogs and toast messages suggests asynchronous operation and user feedback mechanisms are in place. The language setting function and associated UI elements focus on dynamic language switching, utilizing local storage for persistent preferences.\n\n\nThe provided JavaScript updates UI elements with translated text based on the current language setting, confirming previous observations about I18N implementation. UI text for server status and control buttons (start/stop) is updated dynamically.  Language toggling and persistent storage of language preference are supported. Finally, a timer function is implemented, suggesting the system may have long-running operations.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add I18N translation dictionary, language toggle, and timer helpers to index.html script","EndLine":1176,"Instruction":"Insert I18N definitions and language/timer helper functions in script","ReplacementContent":"    <script>\nconst I18N = {\n    ar: {\n        brand_title: \"فارما ماتش\",\n        brand_subtitle: \"Pharmacy Matcher\",\n        lang_btn: \"EN\",\n        \n        // Navigation\n        nav_new: \"عملية مطابقة جديدة\",\n        nav_history: \"سجل العمليات\",\n        nav_settings: \"إعدادات النظام\",\n        nav_logs: \"سجل النظام (Terminal)\",\n        server_checking: \"جاري التحقق...\",\n        server_running: \"السيرفر يعمل\",\n        server_stopped: \"السيرفر متوقف\",\n        btn_start_server: \"تشغيل السيرفر\",\n        btn_stop_server: \"إيقاف السيرفر\",\n        btn_exit_app: \"إغلاق البرنامج\",\n\n        // Screen New\n        new_title: \"مطابقة نواقص ومخازن جديدة\",\n        new_desc: \"قم بإدراج ملفات النواقص وملفات المخازن للبدء في المطابقة الذكية.\",\n        shortages_title: \"1. ملفات النواقص\",\n        shortages_drop_title: \"اضغط لاختيار الملفات\",\n        shortages_drop_sub: \"(يدعم PDF / Excel)\",\n        warehouses_title: \"2. قوائم المخازن\",\n        warehouses_drop_title: \"اضغط لاختيار الملفات\",\n        warehouses_drop_sub: \"(يدعم PDF / Excel / JSON)\",\n        browse_files: \"تصفح الملفات\",\n        btn_start_matching: \"بدء عملية المطابقة\",\n        progress_init: \"جاري تهيئة العملية...\",\n        progress_sub: \"العملية تعمل في الخلفية. يمكنك متابعة السجلات من تبويب \\\"سجل النظام\\\".\",\n\n        // Screen Results\n        results_title: \"تقرير نتائج المطابقة\",\n        results_desc: \"تم الانتهاء من فحص الملفات وإنشاء تقرير الإكسيل بنجاح.\",\n        stat_total_title: \"إجمالي الأصناف المطلوبة\",\n        stat_matched_title: \"تمت المطابقة بنجاح\",\n        stat_review_title: \"يحتاج مراجعة (غير مؤكد)\",\n        stat_notfound_title: \"غير متوفر في المخازن\",\n        workflow_title: \"خطوات المراجعة النهائية:\",\n        step1_title: \"افتح ملف الإكسيل\",\n        step1_desc: \"اضغط على الزر لفتح الملف، ثم اذهب لشيت \\\"يحتاج مراجعة\\\".\",\n        btn_open_excel: \"فتح الإكسيل\",\n        step2_title: \"راجع واتخذ القرار\",\n        step2_desc: \"اختر (✅ مطابق) أو (❌ غير مطابق) لكل صنف، ثم احفظ الملف وأغلقه.\",\n        step3_title: \"طبق التعديلات\",\n        step3_desc: \"اضغط هنا لنقل الأصناف لشيتات المخازن وتنظيف القائمة.\",\n        btn_apply_reviews: \"تنفيذ التعديلات\",\n        btn_open_folder: \"فتح مجلد حفظ النتائج (Folder)\",\n\n        // Screen History\n        history_title: \"سجل العمليات السابقة\",\n        history_desc: \"هنا تجد جميع عمليات المطابقة التي قمت بها سابقاً، يمكنك العودة إليها في أي وقت.\",\n        history_empty: \"لا توجد عمليات سابقة مسجلة.\",\n        status_completed: \"مكتمل\",\n        status_reviewing: \"قيد المراجعة\",\n        status_processing: \"قيد التشغيل...\",\n        status_error: \"فشل\",\n        btn_view_results: \"عرض النتائج\",\n        btn_restart: \"إعادة تشغيل\",\n        badge_shortages: \"نواقص\",\n        badge_warehouses: \"مخازن\",\n        process_label: \"العملية\",\n\n        // Screen Settings\n        settings_title: \"إعدادات النظام\",\n        settings_desc: \"قم بضبط إعدادات الربط مع سيرفر الذكاء الاصطناعي (MSEMAX) و Unstructured API وجودة الاستخراج.\",\n        api_keys_header: \"مفاتيح الربط وخيارات المعالجة\",\n        lbl_unstructured_profile: \"وضع معالجة PDF (Parse Profile)\",\n        opt_profile_best: \"جودة فائقة (Best - دقة عالية جداً للأسماء الطبية)\",\n        opt_profile_balanced: \"متوازن (Balanced - أسرع)\",\n        profile_note: \"Best يضمن دقة قراءة الأسماء الطبية العربية المعقدة ويمنع أخطاء الحروف.\",\n        lbl_unstructured_key: \"Unstructured API Key\",\n        lbl_local_url: \"Local AI URL (MSEMAX / vLLM)\",\n        lbl_local_key: \"Local AI Key (إن وجد)\",\n        lbl_model_name: \"اسم الموديل (Model Name)\",\n        server_header: \"إعدادات سيرفر (MSEMAX)\",\n        lbl_msemax_dir: \"مسار مجلد MSEMAX\",\n        btn_select_dir: \"تحديد المجلد\",\n        btn_install_reqs: \"تثبيت متطلبات الجهاز الأساسية\",\n        btn_renew_session: \"تجديد الجلسة (Get Session)\",\n        btn_save_settings: \"حفظ الإعدادات\",\n        system_logs_title: \"سجل النظام (System Logs)\",\n\n        // Screen Terminal\n        terminal_title: \"سجل النظام (Terminal)\",\n        terminal_subtitle: \"يُظهر مخرجات العمليات الجارية في الخلفية\",\n\n        // Dialogs & Confirmations\n        confirm_exit_title: \"تأكيد الإغلاق\",\n        confirm_exit_msg: \"توجد عمليات مطابقة قيد التشغيل في الخلفية. هل أنت متأكد من الإغلاق؟\",\n        confirm_delete_title: \"تأكيد الحذف\",\n        confirm_delete_msg: \"هل أنت متأكد من حذف هذه العملية نهائياً من السجل؟\",\n        toast_deleted: \"تم الحذف بنجاح\",\n        toast_started: \"بدأت العملية بنجاح في الخلفية\",\n        toast_saved: \"تم حفظ الإعدادات بنجاح\",\n        toast_matching_done: \"تمت المطابقة بنجاح!\",\n        toast_reviews_applied: \"تم تنفيذ التعديلات بنجاح!\",\n        select_at_least_one: \"يرجى اختيار ملف نواقص وملف مخزن واحد على الأقل\",\n        process_existing: \"هذه العملية مسجلة بالفعل، جاري عرض النتائج...\"\n    },\n    en: {\n        brand_title: \"Pharma Match\",\n        brand_subtitle: \"Pharmacy Matcher\",\n        lang_btn: \"عربي\",\n\n        // Navigation\n        nav_new: \"New Match Process\",\n        nav_history: \"Process History\",\n        nav_settings: \"System Settings\",\n        nav_logs: \"System Logs (Terminal)\",\n        server_checking: \"Checking...\",\n        server_running: \"Server Running\",\n        server_stopped: \"Server Stopped\",\n        btn_start_server: \"Start Server\",\n        btn_stop_server: \"Stop Server\",\n        btn_exit_app: \"Exit Application\",\n\n        // Screen New\n        new_title: \"Match Shortages & Warehouses\",\n        new_desc: \"Import shortages and warehouse lists to run smart AI matching.\",\n        shortages_title: \"1. Shortage Files\",\n        shortages_drop_title: \"Click or drag files here\",\n        shortages_drop_sub: \"(Supports PDF / Excel)\",\n        warehouses_title: \"2. Warehouse Lists\",\n        warehouses_drop_title: \"Click or drag files here\",\n        warehouses_drop_sub: \"(Supports PDF / Excel / JSON)\",\n        browse_files: \"Browse Files\",\n        btn_start_matching: \"Start Matching Process\",\n        progress_init: \"Initializing process...\",\n        progress_sub: \"Process is running in background. You can track logs in the System Logs tab.\",\n\n        // Screen Results\n        results_title: \"Matching Results Report\",\n        results_desc: \"File analysis completed and Excel report generated successfully.\",\n        stat_total_title: \"Total Requested Items\",\n        stat_matched_title: \"Matched Successfully\",\n        stat_review_title: \"Needs Review (Uncertain)\",\n        stat_notfound_title: \"Not Found in Warehouses\",\n        workflow_title: \"Final Review Steps:\",\n        step1_title: \"Open Excel File\",\n        step1_desc: \"Click to open file, then go to 'Needs Review' sheet.\",\n        btn_open_excel: \"Open Excel\",\n        step2_title: \"Review & Decide\",\n        step2_desc: \"Select (✅ Match) or (❌ No Match) for each item, then save and close.\",\n        step3_title: \"Apply Changes\",\n        step3_desc: \"Click here to transfer items to warehouse sheets and clean the list.\",\n        btn_apply_reviews: \"Apply Changes\",\n        btn_open_folder: \"Open Results Folder\",\n\n        // Screen History\n        history_title: \"Process History\",\n        history_desc: \"Here you can find all previous matching runs and return to them anytime.\",\n        history_empty: \"No previous operations recorded.\",\n        status_completed: \"Completed\",\n        status_reviewing: \"Under Review\",\n        status_processing: \"Running...\",\n        status_error: \"Failed\",\n        btn_view_results: \"View Results\",\n        btn_restart: \"Restart\",\n        badge_shortages: \"shortages\",\n        badge_warehouses: \"warehouses\",\n        process_label: \"Process\",\n\n        // Screen Settings\n        settings_title: \"System Settings\",\n        settings_desc: \"Configure AI server (MSEMAX), Unstructured API, and extraction profile.\",\n        api_keys_header: \"API Keys & Processing Options\",\n        lbl_unstructured_profile: \"PDF Parse Profile\",\n        opt_profile_best: \"High Precision (Best - Highest accuracy for Arabic drugs)\",\n        opt_profile_balanced: \"Balanced (Faster processing)\",\n        profile_note: \"Best eliminates OCR misreads on complex Arabic medical names.\",\n        lbl_unstructured_key: \"Unstructured API Key\",\n        lbl_local_url: \"Local AI URL (MSEMAX / vLLM)\",\n        lbl_local_key: \"Local AI Key (Optional)\",\n        lbl_model_name: \"Model Name\",\n        server_header: \"Server Settings (MSEMAX)\",\n        lbl_msemax_dir: \"MSEMAX Directory Path\",\n        btn_select_dir: \"Select Folder\",\n        btn_install_reqs: \"Install Core Requirements\",\n        btn_renew_session: \"Renew Session (Get Session)\",\n        btn_save_settings: \"Save Settings\",\n        system_logs_title: \"System Logs\",\n\n        // Screen Terminal\n        terminal_title: \"System Logs (Terminal)\",\n        terminal_subtitle: \"Displays background process output in real-time\",\n\n        // Dialogs & Confirmations\n        confirm_exit_title: \"Confirm Exit\",\n        confirm_exit_msg: \"Matching processes are currently running in the background. Are you sure you want to exit?\",\n        confirm_delete_title: \"Confirm Deletion\",\n        confirm_delete_msg: \"Are you sure you want to permanently delete this process from history?\",\n        toast_deleted: \"Deleted successfully\",\n        toast_started: \"Process started in the background\",\n        toast_saved: \"Settings saved successfully\",\n        toast_matching_done: \"Matching completed successfully!\",\n        toast_reviews_applied: \"Changes applied successfully!\",\n        select_at_least_one: \"Please select at least one shortage file and one warehouse file\",\n        process_existing: \"This run already exists, loading results...\"\n    }\n};\n\nlet currentLang = localStorage.getItem('pharmacy_app_lang') || 'ar';\nlet progressTimerInterval = null;\nlet progressStartTime = null;\n\nfunction setLanguage(lang) {\n    currentLang = lang;\n    localStorage.setItem('pharmacy_app_lang', lang);\n    const htmlEl = document.documentElement;\n    htmlEl.lang = lang;\n    htmlEl.dir = lang === 'ar' ? 'rtl' : 'ltr';\n\n    const t = I18N[lang] || I18N.ar;\n\n    // Update label on toggle button\n    const labelEl = document.getElementById('lang-label');\n    if (labelEl) labelEl.textContent = t.lang_btn;\n\n    // Update all elements with data-i18n\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-i18n]').forEach(el => {\n        const key = el.getAttribute('data-i18n');\n        if (t[key]) {\n            el.textContent = t[key];\n        }\n    });\n\n    // Update select options for profile\n    const optBest = document.querySelector('#setting-unstructured-profile option[value=\"best\"]');\n    if (optBest) optBest.textContent = t.opt_profile_best;\n    const optBalanced = document.querySelector('#setting-unstructured-profile option[value=\"balanced\"]');\n    if (optBalanced) optBalanced.textContent = t.opt_profile_balanced;\n\n    // Update server status text if currently static\n    updateServerStatusTextO